{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-03","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"chemistry","number":3,"points":2,"unitId":"acid","unitLabel":"산·염기 평형","topic":"산해리·염기성","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["acid","equilibrium"],"stem":"표는 수용액에서 몇 가지 화학종의 산해리 상수(K)를 나타낸 \n것이다.\nK\n화학종\n6.3×10－4\nHF\n+\n5.6×10－10\nNH4\n6.2×10－10\nHCN\nCH3COOH\n1.8×10－5\n표의 자료에 근거하여 설명한 것으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서\n있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. MF2의 용해도는 0.01M 염산 수용액에서보다 물에서 더 \n크다.\nㄴ. 0.10M NH4CN 수용액은 염기성이다.\nㄷ. 0.10M CH3COON 수용액은 0.10M NCN 수용액보다 \nH가 더 높다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t024"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":34,"height":32,"region":0,"bbox":[261.9,5.336,13.6,12.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-03/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":501,"height":283,"region":0,"bbox":[67.1,54.136,200.4,113.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-03/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":772,"height":284,"region":0,"bbox":[17.5,232.536,308.8,113.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-meet-science2-03/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":2,"sourceRect":[427.3,153.464,759.1,548.782],"width":331.8,"height":395.318,"items":[{"type":"image","as